# ── D14 weight prune (2026-08-19, Wave-2 PR-8) ───────────────────────────────
# Regenerable renders pruned at HEAD under the same D4 policy above, but living
# OUTSIDE the `_output`/`outputs` scratch dirs, so they need explicit rules —
# otherwise re-running the generator leaves an untracked file and a dirty tree.
# Each was zero-citer under the four-method census (python basename+stem walk ∪
# `git grep -F` ∪ brace/glob expansion ∪ parent-directory scan) and each has an
# in-tree generator, named per file below. NO allowlist line was retired: none
# of these five carried one (the 36-figure EXCEPTIONS block above is untouched).
#
# generator: src/scripts/vol_1_foundations/chiral_lattice_smoke_dynamics.py
src/scripts/vol_1_foundations/genesis_v9_figs/smoke_a_dispersion.png
src/scripts/vol_1_foundations/genesis_v9_figs/smoke_b_optical_activity.png
